te bench or seating element that anchors the composition. Lush greenery frames the scene: manicured shrubs, young deciduous trees with sparse, delicate branches reaching skyward, and mature evergreens providing contrast and organic softness against the rigid architecture. To the left, a second mid-rise building mirrors the main tower’s design language, reinforcing the development’s cohesive aesthetic. The sky above is a gradient of pale azure transitioning to warm amber near the horizon, suggesting late afternoon clarity with a subtle haze lending atmospheric depth. Fine details include subtle reflections on glass surfaces, fine grain textures on concrete, realistic foliage shadows, and precise lighting transitions that emphasize form and volume. The overall mood is serene, sophisticated, and aspirational—a vision of contemporary urban living harmoniously integrated with nature, rendered with photographic fidelity and cinematic lighting for maximum immersive impact."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 27, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [345.8955078125, 202], "color": "#322", "pos": [4508.2529296875, 3009.256103515625], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [16], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314.0000305175781], "pos": [5101.5947265625, 2685.034423828125], "widgets_values": ["81af4489ea3b6e0970c3189a15857